  "description": "The meme format 'no one: steven hawking' implies Hawking is the only one who cannot do something, reducing his complex achievements to his physical condition. This perpetuates ableist stereotypes by normalizing the objectification of disability and potentially contributing to stigma, which can be harmful to individuals with disabilities and society's perception of them.",
